kiwix-serve
Usage: kiwix-serve --port PORT ZIM.zim

Serves offline .zim archives -- wikipedia, survival guides, docs -- over http on
localhost, so you can browse them in `links` with no network at all. Point it at
the zims on the XOS-KNOW stick.

	--port PORT    listen on this port (then open it in links)
	ZIM.zim        one or more archives to serve

See also: kiwix-search, links
